{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the judge, you\u2019ll hear cases, read letters, uncover lies - and decide between justice or corruption. Every verdict affects your reputation with powerful factions: the King, the People, and the Church.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rule with wisdom, or fall to pressure, power, or greed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Moral choices with lasting impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic reputation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Faction interaction: King, People, Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bribes, threats, and political pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pixel-art medieval visual style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully localized: English, French, Russian<br><br><strong>Note:</strong> The game is currently in a closed beta until its official release. This store page is available for wishlisting. The beta build is used only for internal testing and is not accessible to players until the release date.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990340?t=1759603336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990340?t=1759603336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990340/7f0db047c22946606ed213150169778dc94852ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759603336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990340/7f0db047c22946606ed213150169778dc94852ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759603336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the judge, you\u2019ll hear cases, read letters, uncover lies - and decide between justice or corruption. E